<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back further 489,500 shares.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back further 489,500 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said it bought back a further 489,500 shares between NZ$6.34 and $6.38 on Tuesday in its $1 billion buyback programme.</p>
<p>The shares closed eight cents lower at $6.35.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
